  "description": "Step right up to Krevvick's carnival of ghosts, where the ticket taker has no face and the carousel horses scream when you pass! You've got ten fixed paylines across a five-by-three reel grid, so keep your eyes on the reels even when the midway lights go out. Catch the free spins round and keep the show rolling without paying for those spins. When Hold and Respin kicks in, spectral ticket symbols stay locked while the other positions spin again. Hear that bell? Krevvick's calling you back to the midway!",
